@startuml
title PayLink - Pay a Bill

actor Customer
participant "PayLink System" as PayLink
participant "Biller Company" as Biller

== Bill Inquiry ==

Customer -> PayLink: Select biller and enter bill details
PayLink -> Biller: Request bill information
Biller --> PayLink: Return bill amount
PayLink -> PayLink: Calculate service fee and total
PayLink --> Customer: Display amount, fee and total

== Payment ==

Customer -> PayLink: Confirm payment

PayLink -> PayLink: Check duplicate request
PayLink -> PayLink: Check limits and fraud rules

alt Invalid request or insufficient balance
    PayLink --> Customer: Reject payment with reason

else Valid payment

    PayLink -> PayLink: Hold wallet funds
    PayLink -> Biller: Send payment request

    alt Payment successful
        Biller --> PayLink: Payment confirmed
        PayLink -> PayLink: Complete payment and record transaction
        PayLink --> Customer: Send SMS and Push notification

    else Payment failed
        Biller --> PayLink: Payment rejected
        PayLink -> PayLink: Release held funds
        PayLink --> Customer: Send failure notification

    else Biller timeout
        Biller --> PayLink: No response within 10 seconds
        PayLink -> PayLink: Set status to Unknown
        Note over PayLink
          Keep funds held.
          Retry checking payment status
          up to 3 times.
        end note
        PayLink --> Customer: Payment is being processed
    end
end

@enduml